## Update: SSE transport via supergateway also fails

Tested wrapping the stdio server in an HTTP/SSE layer using supergateway, since cloud MCP servers (which use HTTP) register tools fine.

### Setup

1. Started supergateway proxying `server-filesystem@0.6.2` over SSE on `http://localhost:8100/sse`
2. Updated `.mcp.json` to use SSE transport:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "obsidian-full-vault": {
      "type": "sse",
      "url": "http://localhost:8100/sse"
    }
  }
}
```
3. Verified superga
